  <para style="h">Mejieghasan Shu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mejieghasan Shu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mejieghasan</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mej</para>
  <para style="mt">Mejieghasan Shu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1"/>
  <para style="s">Shuni Melieduku Kielien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1"/>Eneshi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha mejieghasan wo. Deigo fashen giene giesan shiqinni hojiladene uzheghane giezhi Huda <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de mejieghasan wo. Ingiese <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha qienxienne peizhi <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> hojidene qinchude mejieghawo. <verse eid="REV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2"/><char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> chanlasanlane man ganzhen beiwo. Jiushi Hudai kielien, pse <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha hhende mejieghasanlai ganzhen beizhi kieliewo. <verse eid="REV 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3"/>Ene shu jiere melie kieliesanlai onshizhi chenliezhi hhende jilasei zunjisanlade fuqi wine. Shihou chadashiwo.<verse eid="REV 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dolon Jiohuide Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="REV 1:4-5"/>
    <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>ni dolon jiohuide xin huaizho. Edeku, eqighanku, jianlai ireku Huda, hhei baozo meliededu dolon ruhher, pse shixinji ganzhen beisan, fugusan kun dundase tou 1 giede aminne olusan, duyai honshan dunda touzi danlasan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4-5">Hhe matande orezhi goya chusunghalane zuise mai andaghazhi <verse eid="REV 1:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6"/>gojia gholughazhi hhei ada Hudai melie buwa danlaghawo. Kuaiku, qienlini <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihade chanqi izhi ogi! Amine.<verse eid="REV 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7"/>Uzhe, hhe olien jiere irene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">Jien kunla hhei uzhene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">Hhei chujisan kunlaye uzhene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">Duya jieredu minzula man hhei yenyinzhe wilane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">Shuhuajia ingiene. Amine!<verse eid="REV 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8"/>Ezhan Huda kieliezho, "Bishi Alafa wo, Emeiga wo. Bishi edeku, eqighanku, jianlai ireku, nenlitu Huda wo."<verse eid="REV 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ersa Mexiha Yaheiyade Chanlaghazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9"/>Bishi tai gaijiu <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> wo. <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende tanre hhantu kunnan shouiku, Hudai gojia, rennai giekude guzide wine. Bi Hudai kieliende oluzhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de ganzhen beiku yenyinghala <char style="png">Bamo</char> giesan haini dao jiere bafanzi souzho. <verse eid="REV 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10"/>Ezhanni udude Shenlin mii zhughei gojiolughazhi mii khuina laba tunguliesan mutun fugie shenqii bi sonosuwo. <verse eid="REV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11"/>Hhe shenqi kieliezho, "Chi chanlasanne man shu jiere huaizhi <char style="png">Ifuso</char>, <char style="png">Shimeina</char>, <char style="png">Biejiamo</char>, <char style="png">Tuiyatuila</char>, <char style="png">Saji</char>, <char style="png">Feilaqiefei</char>, <char style="png">Laojijia</char> ene dolon jiohuide khugho!"<verse eid="REV 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12"/>Bi ochira kien made kielien kieliesei uzhene giezho. Ochira daozhese dolon antanni zhula teizii chanlawo. <verse eid="REV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13"/>Zhula teizi dunda niekozi kun hoxian kunni kewonni xianli. Fudu jien musizhi konde bouzho, antanghala echanne huighazho. <verse eid="REV 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14"/>Hhei qiorun, usun chighande ghonini noghosun, chasunyi xianli. Nudunni khan giedai xianli. <verse eid="REV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15"/>Konni hoxian luzide siderasan gieghan tunni xianli. Shenqini olon usu usurusan shenqii xianli. <verse eid="REV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16"/>Hhei borun khade dolon hodun wine. Amanseni niekozi ghua renzitu xidu khudogho khizhezhi ungieni gon faisan hherei naranni xianli.<verse eid="REV 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17"/>Bi hhei chanladene fugusan mutun hhei kon kondei fura bouwo. Hhe borun khane mii jiere teizhi kieliewo, "Bu ayi! Bishi tou 1 gie wo, zuihouku wo, <verse eid="REV 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18"/>chanqi biku wo. Uzhe, bi fuguzhi daozhoma, ede chanqi izhi amiturazho. Dou fugukuji dozoni yeshi made wine. <verse eid="REV 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19"/>Chi chanlasanlane man huaizhi jila. Jiushi edeku shiqinji khuina gholuku shiqin wo. <verse eid="REV 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20"/>Chi chanlasan mii borun khani dolon hodun, pse dolon antanni zhula teizini mimishi ene wo. Dolon hodunshi dolon jiohuini qienxien wo, dolon zhula teizishi dolon jiohui wo."<verse eid="REV 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ifuso Jiohuide Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1"/>"Chi <char style="png">Ifuso</char> jiohuini qienxiende xin huaizhi kielie, 'Borun khadene dolon hodunni bareizhi dolon antanni zhula teizi dunda yosan hhe kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2"/>Chi giesan, khishulasan, rennai giesei bi mejiene. Doghun kunlai ulie roulieseiye mejiene. Goyaneshi shitu wo giezhoma, shijishan pushotulai chi kaoyen giedene jianini khizheghazho. <verse eid="REV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3"/>Chi rennai giezhi mii nierede oluzhi jienchi giezhi hhechekune mejie dazho. <verse eid="REV 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4"/>Ingieliuzhe ene nie shiqinde bi chii kheilane, dei qiikude orekui chi widaghazho. <verse eid="REV 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5"/>Ingiese chi nie sumula. Khalase banjizhoshi hhense geizhen giezhi dei qiikude giesan wilielai gie. Chi geizhen ulie giese bi chii hhende iredene zhula teiziichii yenlaiku oronse agi echine. <verse eid="REV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6"/>Ingieliuzhe chade intu nie gou shiqin wine. <char style="pn">Nigela</char> paini giesanlai bi henjisan mutun chi henjizho. <verse eid="REV 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7"/>Chighin bitu kunla Shenlin jiohuilade kieliesan kielienni chenliendu. Injisan kunlade Hudai qientanyi aminni mutunni alimai ogizhi ijieghane.'"<verse eid="REV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shimeina Jiohuide Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8"/>"Chi <char style="png">Shimeina</char> jiohuini qienxiende xin huaizhi kielie, 'Tou 1 gie, zuihouku, fugudene aminne olusan hhe kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9"/>Chii kunnan, nanxinni bi mejiene. Shijishan chi bayan wo. Hhezighan goyalaneshi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo giesan kunla tai sugiesanyi bi mejiene. Shijishan hhelashi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun pusho, Ibilisire hhantuku kun wo. <verse eid="REV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10"/>Chade kuzhene giesan kuse chi bu ayi. Uzhe, Ibilisi tai dundadu ezighan kunlai bafanzide khazhi tai shiine. Tai hharudu zayalane. Chi fugutula shixinji giese bi chade aminni maghalai ogine. <verse eid="REV 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11"/>Chighin bitu kunla Shenlin jiohuilade kieliesan kielienni chenliendu. Injisan kunlai ji 2 gie fuguku hei dane.'"<verse eid="REV 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biejiamo Jiohuide Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12"/>"Chi <char style="png">Biejiamo</char> jiohuini qienxiende xin huaizhi kielie, 'Ghua renzitu xidu khudogho winetu hhe kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13"/>Chi sousan oronni bi mejiene, Ibilisii baozo hhende wo. Made shixinji ganzhen beisan <char style="png">Anqipa</char>i tai hhende, jiushi Ibilisi sousan oronde alakude chi mii nierei goude zunjizhi mii xianxin giesanni ese bendawo. <verse eid="REV 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14"/>Ingieliuzhe giedun shiqin jiere bi chii kheilane. Tai dundadu niezhan kunla <char style="pn">Balan</char> sughasei shunjizho. <char style="pn">Balan</char> <char style="pn">Bale</char>de sughazhi <char style="png">Isilie</char> bexinlai zui fanjighazhi nigiedade teisan dunxii ijieghazhi lon kijieghazho. <verse eid="REV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15"/>Niekielien wo, chii hhende niezhan kunla <char style="pn">Nigela</char> paini surughasei shunjizho. <verse eid="REV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16"/>Ingiese chi geizhen gie. Pse bi chii hhende irezhi amanne khudoghoghala enelai eghine. <verse eid="REV 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17"/>Chighin bitu kunla Shenlin jiohuilade kieliesan kielienni chenliendu. Injisan kunlade bi niuighasan manani ogizhi pse chighan tashii ogine. Tashi jiere shini niere huaizho. Jienliesan kunse chugo tanichen kun nieda uwo.'"<verse eid="REV 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuiyatuila Jiohuide Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18"/>"Chi <char style="png">Tuiyatuila</char> jiohuini qienxiende xin huaizhi kielie, 'Nudunni khan gieda mutun, konni gieghan tun mutun Hudai kewon kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19"/>Chii gieku, oreku, xianxin gieku, kunlade oluzhi gieku, rennai giekui bi mejiene. Chi khuinashi giesan melieshi giesanse da olon bikuiye mejiene. <verse eid="REV 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20"/>Ingieliuzhe ene nie shiqinde bi chii kheilane. Goyaneshi xienzhi wo giesan bierei <char style="pn">Yexibie</char>ni chi renjizho. Hhe mii hojilade sughazhi hhelai miidene lon kijieghazhi nigiedade teisan dunxii ijieghazho. <verse eid="REV 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21"/>Bi hhende geizhen gieku jihui ogizhi daozhoma, hhe lon kijiekune geizhen ulie geine. <verse eid="REV 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22"/>Bi jingao gieye. Bi deigo hhei giemereghazhi chonban jiere bendane. Hhere hhantu piofen giesanlaye hhe giesanlai geizhen ulie giese fugie zeinan dunda bendane. <verse eid="REV 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23"/>Bi hhere niekielienji giesan kunlai alane. Ingiese soyuji jiohuila man bishi kunni sumuladanji zhughei uzhechen bikui mejiene. Bi tai giekuzhe jien kunde kharulune. <verse eid="REV 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24"/>Ta <char style="png">Tuiyatuila</char>dedu hhe sughasei ese shunjisan, kunla kieliese Ibilisini chijia isi wo giesanni ese surusan kunlade bi kielieye, bi psedu achanni tai jiere ulie teine. <verse eid="REV 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25"/>Zinie bi iretula ta bisanne goude barei. <verse eid="REV 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26"/>Injisan, mii isii zunjizhi zuihou kusan kunlade bi soyuji gojialai gonjiku qienli ogine. <verse eid="REV 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27"/>Hhe kun qiemu zhugunghala waganganyi ghalughaku mutun hhelai gonjine. <verse eid="REV 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28"/>Eneshi bi adasene linlasan qienlighala niekielien wo. Bi pse eqiemaghaku hodunni hhende ogine. <verse eid="REV 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29"/>Chighin bitu kunla Shenlin jiohuilade kieliesan kielienni chenliendu!'"<verse eid="REV 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3"/>
  <para style="s">Saji Jiohuide Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1"/>"Chi <char style="png">Saji</char> jiohuini qienxiende xin huaizhi kielie, 'Hudai dolon ruhher, dolon hodun winetu hhe kieliezho. Chi giekui bi mejiene, zhao niereghala chi amitu woma, shijishan chi fuguzho. <verse eid="REV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2"/>Chi xiereidene deigo fugune giezhi goujinie feiliesanlai khiduzhegha. Bi mejiese chi giesanla mii Hudai melie hulunni nieda uwo. <verse eid="REV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3"/>Ingiese chi daolini matugie jienliezhi chenliesei jiladene zunjizhi geizhen gie. Chi ulie xiereise bi ghughei mutun irene, bi yan xienzide chii hhende irekui chi jiedui ulie mejiene. <verse eid="REV 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4"/>Ingieliuzhe <char style="png">Saji</char>de niezhanla jienne ese zannanshighazhi hhela pei shidadene chighan jien musizhi bighala hhantu yone. <verse eid="REV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5"/>Injisan kunla ingiezhi chighan jien musizhi hhelai nierei aminni jilasan benzi jierese ulie widaghane. Bi adane melie, hhei qienxienlai melie hhelai nierei chenren giene. <verse eid="REV 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6"/>Chighin bitu kunla Shenlin jiohuilade kieliesan kielienni chenliendu!'"<verse eid="REV 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feilaqiefei Jiohuide Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7"/>"Chi <char style="png">Feilaqiefei</char> jiohuini qienxiende xin huaizhi kielie, '<char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni yeshii bareizhi niese kiemada kha dane, khase kiemada nie daku hhe zhiguitu, zhenni kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8"/>Chi giekui bi mejiene. Chade goujinie lilian bizhi mii kielienyi zunjizhi mii nierei ese ghudanduzho. Uzhe, bi chii melie nie keighasan wijienni teiwo, kiemada kha dane. <verse eid="REV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9"/>Hhezighan Ibilisire hhantuku kunla, goyaneshi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo giezhoma shijishan pushotu ghudanchilai bi chii kon melie xiutulieghazhi bi chade oresei hhelade mejieghane. <verse eid="REV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10"/>Chi mii kielienyi zunjizhi rennai giezho. Ingiese duyai kunlai man kaoyen gieku shihoude bi chii baohu giene. <verse eid="REV 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11"/>Bi ghujighande irene. Chi bisanlane goude barei, pse jianli giesan maghalai kunla qianla echine. <verse eid="REV 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12"/>Injisan kunlai mii Hudai dajiende tuhua danlaghazhi pse likai ulie gieghane. Bi Hudane nierei, Hudai chenshii nierei, pse mii shini nierei man hhei jiere huaine. Ene chenshishi asimanse, mii Hudai hhense bouzhesan shini <char style="png">Yelusalen</char> wo. <verse eid="REV 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13"/>Chighin bitu kunla Shenlin jiohuilade kieliesan kielienni chenliendu!'"<verse eid="REV 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laojijia Jiohuide Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14"/>"Chi <char style="png">Laojijia</char> jiohuini qienxiende xin huaizhi kielie, 'Hhe Amine giesan, shixinji shuhua ganzhen beisan, Huda zhayaghasan genzi kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15"/>Chi giekui bi mejiene, chi kuiqienye uwo, hhereiye uwo. Mii duranshi chi kuiqien onu hhereishijiu. <verse eid="REV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16"/>Chi unchu usu mutun kuiqien wiji hherei uwoshi bi chii amansene nunpu khighane. <verse eid="REV 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17"/>Chi kieliese bi bayan wo, facai giezhi yama ese chaizho giezhoma, chade lolien, ubali, nanxin, sugho, hulan muchughun bikui chi ulie mejiene. <verse eid="REV 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18"/>Bi chade sughaye, chi mase khanghala tuliezhi daosan antanni agizhi goyane bayazhegha. Chighan jien agizhi musidene hulan muchughun shizhekune bu khizhegha. Pse nienye agizhi teidene nudunne chanlagha. <verse eid="REV 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19"/>Jien bi oresanlade kheilazhi gonjine. Ingiese chi rexinne khizhegha, geizhen gie. <verse eid="REV 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20"/>Uzhe, bi ghadane beidene wijienyi eghizho. Mii shenqii sonosudene wijienyi niese bi hhei hhende orozhi bi hheghala, hhe bighala hhantu ijiene. <verse eid="REV 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21"/>Injisan kunlai bi baozo jierene goyarene hhantu soughane. Hoxian bi injidene adane baozo jiere hhere hhantu souku niekielien wo. <verse eid="REV 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22"/>Chighin bitu kunla Shenlin jiohuilade kieliesan kielienni chenliendu!'"<verse eid="REV 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4"/>
  <para style="s">Asiman Jiere Hudade Libai Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1"/>Enense khuinashi bi chanlase asiman jieredu wijien niezho. Bi eqighandei sonosusan laba feiliesan shenqi mutun made kieliezho, "Chi mii enende khizhe. Ihou kenjin gholuku shiqinlai bi chade uzheghaye." <verse eid="REV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2"/>Shenlin deigo mii zhughei gojiolughazhi bi chanlase asiman jiere nie baozo wine. Hhende niekozi souzho. <verse eid="REV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3"/>Hhe sousei uzhese noghon ishi, hulan boushini xianli. Pse baozoni lun sulasan wiqizhi noghon boushini xianli. <verse eid="REV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4"/>Baozoni izhonde 24 gie zowi wo. Zowi jiere 24 gie zhanlao souzho, chighan jien musizhi qiorun jiere antanni maghala zhozho. <verse eid="REV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5"/>Shanjien, olien tunguliesan fugie shenqi baozose khizhezho. Pse dolon hoba baozo melie siderazho. Ene dolon zhulashi Hudai dolon ruhher wo. <verse eid="REV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6"/>Baozo melie nie boli mutun hai, shuijinyi xianli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Baozo zhouwini simiende jieran amitu ojien wo, beyeni melie khuina nudun duruzho. <verse eid="REV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7"/>Tou 1 gie shizini xianli, ji 2 gie fughereini xianli, ji 3 gieni ungie kunni ungiei xianli, ji 4 gie musisan inni xianli. <verse eid="REV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8"/>Jieran amitu ojiende niede zhighon siban wo, beye jiereni nudun duruzho. Hhela udu xieniji ese beidene kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">"Zhigui! Zhigui! Zhigui!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">Ezhan, Fugie Nenlitu Hudashi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">eqighanku, edeku, jianlai ireku wo."<verse eid="REV 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9"/>Jieran amitu ojien kuaiku, zhigui, mafan giekui baozo jiere sousan, chanqi izhi amituku hhende niefanie ogikude, <verse eid="REV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10"/>24 gie zhanlao baozo sousan chanqi izhi amituku hhende papaladene beiizhi goya maghalane baozo konde teidene kieliezho,<verse eid="REV 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11"/>"Mai Ezhan, mai Huda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kuaiku, zhigui, nenlini pei shidane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Chi yanyanjilai zhayaghazho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">Yanyanjilashi chii isighala zhayaghadene bisan wo."<verse eid="REV 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ghoni Ghughan Shuni Keighazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1"/>Bi chanlase baozo sousei borun khade horosan shu wine. Ghadane, sudoroji uru huaizhi dolon fenqioghala fenjizho. <verse eid="REV 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2"/>Bi pse chanlase nie lilian fugietu qienxien fugiede waradazhi kieliezho, "Kien fenqioni keighazhi shuni keighakui pei shidane?" <verse eid="REV 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3"/>Asiman jiere, zemin jiere, zemin doura hhe shuni keighazhi onshichen uwo. <verse eid="REV 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4"/>Peizhi keighazhi onshichen wise bi hende wilazho. <verse eid="REV 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5"/>Zhanlao dundase niekozi made kieliezho, "Bu wila! Uzhe, <char style="png">Yuda</char> paini shizi, jiushi <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni houdei ijin injiwo. Hhe shuni keighazhi dolon fenqioni keigha shidane!"<verse eid="REV 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6"/>Bi pse chanlase baozo, jieran amitu ojien, zhanlao dunda nie ghoni ghughan beizho. Alazhi daosei xianli. Hhende dolon gocha, dolon nudun wine, eneshi duyai gochude peizhi echighasan Hudai dolon ruhher wo. <verse eid="REV 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7"/>Ene ghoni ghughan yo dao baozo sousei borun khase shuni agiwo. <verse eid="REV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8"/>Shuni agise jieran amitu ojien, 24 gie zhanlao ghoni ghughanyi melie papalawo. Manla qin, xian durusan antanni luzii bareizho. Ene xianshi shentulai onxian wo. <verse eid="REV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9"/>Hhela shini donghala doulazho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">"Chi shuni agizhi pei shidane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">Dolon fenqioni keighazhi pei shidane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Chii alazhi daozho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">goya chusunghalane Hudade oluzhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">go pai, go kielien, go minzu, go gojialase kunlai agizho.<verse eid="REV 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10"/>Hhelai mai Hudade oluzhi buwatu gojia gholughawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">Zemin jiere qienli bareine."<verse eid="REV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11"/>Bi chanlazhi sonosuse baozo, amitu ojien, zhanlaolai zhouwide olon qienxienlai shenqi wine, hhela olonde shuzi uwo. <verse eid="REV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12"/>Qienxienla fugie shenqighala kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">"Alazhi daosan ghoni ghughan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">nenli, bayan, agheli, lilian,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">zhigui, kuaiku, doulakui peizhi jienlie shidane."<verse eid="REV 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13"/>Bi sonosuse asiman jiere, zemin jiere, zemin doura, hainughun, asiman zemin dunda yanyanji zhayaghasanla man kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">"Doulaku, zhigui, fama, qienlini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">man baozo sousanji ghoni ghughande</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">chanqi izhi ogi!"<verse eid="REV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14"/>Jieran amitu ojien amine giezho. Zhanlaolaye papaladene beiizho.<verse eid="REV 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6"/>
  <para style="s">Zhighon Fenqioni Keighazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1"/>Bi chanlase ghoni ghughan dolon fenqio dundadu ji 1 giei keighakude sonosuse jieran amitu ojien dundadu niekozii shenqini olien tunguliesan mutun, "Chi ire." giezhi kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2"/>Bi chanlase nie chighan morei wine. Morei jiere unusan gunjien bareizhi jianli giesan maghalai hhende ogizho. Hhe khizhedene injizhi pse injine giezho. <verse eid="REV 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3"/>Ji 2 gie fenqioni keighakude bi sonosuse ji 2 gie amitu ojien, "Chi ire." giezhi kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4"/>Pse nie morei khizhewo, hulanni wo. Morei unusande qienlini ogizhi zemin jierese pinnanni agi echise kunla nieniene alandune. Nie fugie khudoghoni hhende ogizho.<verse eid="REV 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5"/>Ji 3 gie fenqioni keighakude bi sonosuse ji 3 gie amitu ojien, "Chi ire." giezhi kieliezho. Bi chanlase nie khara morei wine! Morei jiere unusan khadeni shizhi bareizho. <verse eid="REV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6"/>Bi sonosuse jieran amitu ojien dunda shenqi biku mutun kieliezho, "Niuduku gunzighala 2 jin boudei agine, niuduku gunzighala caigie 6 jin damai agine. Tosun, jiuni zaota bu gie!"<verse eid="REV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7"/>Ji 4 gie fenqioni keighakude bi sonosuse ji 4 gie amitu ojien, "Chi ire." giezhi kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8"/>Bi chanlase nie boro morei wine! Morei jiere unusei niereini Fugu giene, dozohei hhei daghazho. Hhelade qienli ogizhi khudogho, oliesuku, inzhaku gien, yewo enelaghala zemin jieredu 4 fenzhi 1 ni oronde kunlai alane.<verse eid="REV 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9"/>Ji 5 gie fenqioni keighakude bi chanlase sidagha gieku teizi doura Hudai daolide oluzhi, pse hhende ganzhen beisande oluzhi alasan kunlai ruhher wine. <verse eid="REV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10"/>Hhela fugie shenqighala waradazhi kieliezho, "Zhiguitu zhenzhenji Ezhan, chi zemin jiere sousan kunlai ulie panjizhi bijienyi kuighazhi usurusan chusunde bouchou ulie giezhi yan xienzi kune?" <verse eid="REV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11"/>Ingie hhe jien kunde chighan fudu jien ogidene fenfulazhi tanre hhantu hoji danlasan gaijiulai ta mutun deigo alazhi shuzi kutula pse gouji hhamura giezho.<verse eid="REV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12"/>Ji 6 gie fenqioni keighakude bi chanlase zemin hende gojioluzhi naran kharaladene khara bosii xianli, sara hulande chusunyi xianli. <verse eid="REV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13"/>Hodunla asimanse zemin jiere bouzhezho, hoxian kei feiliezhi gojiolughasan uhuago mutunse ese shalasan alima bouzhesan niekielien wo. <verse eid="REV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14"/>Asiman horosan shu mutun horo widawo. Jien ula, haini daoni oronseni noighawo. <verse eid="REV 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15"/>Duyani honshan, fugie noyen, jianjin, bayan kun, lilian fugietu kun, pse jien hoji, hoji ese danlasan kun, man ulai dunde, tashi fenzide niuidene <verse eid="REV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16"/>ulade tashide kieliezho, "Bijienyi jiere bouzhe! Baozo sousei ungiese, ghoni ghughan hokusanse bijienyi niuigha! <verse eid="REV 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17"/>Hhelai hokusan zhunyoni udu kuzhewo, kien bei shidane?"<verse eid="REV 6:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7"/>
  <para style="s">144000 Isilie Kunlade Zhanzi Taizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1"/>Enense khuinashi bi chanlase jieran qienxien zeminni jieran gozide beidene simienni keini duizhi zemin, hai, soyuji mutunlai jiere ese feilieghazho. <verse eid="REV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2"/>Bi pse chanlase dou nie qienxien naran khizheku oronse khizhezho, chanqiku Hudai zhanzini bareizho. Zemin, haini hei shidaku nenlini jienliesan jieran qienxiende fugie shenqighala waradazhi kieliezho, <verse eid="REV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3"/>"Bijien matai Hudai hojilai manlou jiere zhanzi taitula ta zemin, hai, mutunlai bu hei." <verse eid="REV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4"/>Bi sonosuse <char style="png">Isilie</char>ni go paise zhanzi taisan shuzishi 144000 wo.<verse eid="REV 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5"/>
    <char style="pn">Yuda</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">
    <char style="pn">Libien</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">
    <char style="pn">Jiade</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,<verse eid="REV 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6"/>
    <char style="pn">Yashe</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">
    <char style="pn">Nafutali</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">
    <char style="pn">Manaxi</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,<verse eid="REV 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7"/>
    <char style="pn">Ximien</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">
    <char style="pn">Liwi</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">
    <char style="pn">Isajia</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,<verse eid="REV 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8"/>
    <char style="pn">Xibulun</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">
    <char style="pn">Yusufu</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">
    <char style="pn">Bienyamin</char> paise zhanzi taisan 12000 wo.<verse eid="REV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Go Gojiani Olon Kunla Doulazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9"/>Enense khuinashi bi chanlase tebieji olon kun wine. Kiema toulazhi baragha dane. Go gojia, go pai, go minzu, go kielien kieliechen kunlase man irezhi baozo, ghoni ghughani melie beizho, chighan jien musizhi zunshu mutun chalalai bareidene <verse eid="REV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10"/>fugie shenqighala waradazhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">"Jiuiku baozo sousan mai Hudaji ghoni ghughande wine!"<verse eid="REV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11"/>Qienxienla man baozo, zhanlao, jieran amitu ojienlai zhouwide beidene baozo melie papala Hudai beiizhi <verse eid="REV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12"/>kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">"Amine! Zanjiku, kuaiku, agheli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">mafan gieku, zhigui, nenli, lilianni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Mai Hudade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">chanqi izhi ogi! Amine!"<verse eid="REV 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13"/>Zhanlao dunda niekozi made asazho, "Enezighan chighan jien musisanshi kien wo? Hhela khalase irezho?" <verse eid="REV 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14"/>Bi hhende kieliewo, "Mii gujiu, chi mejiene." Hhe made kieliewo, "Enezighan kunla zeinan dundase khizhezhi ghoni ghughanyi chusun hhelai jienni waghazhi chighanshighazho." <verse eid="REV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15"/>Ingiese</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">"Hhela Hudai baozo melie xieni udu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">Hudai dajiende hhei beiizho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Baozo sousan hhe zhanfanghala hhelai huizho.<verse eid="REV 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16"/>Hhela pse ulie oliesune, ulie undasune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Naran, pse hhereini hhelai tulie dane.<verse eid="REV 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17"/>Ingiekushi baozo dundadu ghoni ghughan hhelai chezhezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">udurudene aminni usui bula konde echine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">Huda hhelai nunpusunyi saine."<verse eid="REV 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ji 7 Gie Fenqioni Keighazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1"/>Ghoni ghughan ji 7 gie fenqioni keighakude asiman jiere bangie xioshi yama shenqi uwo. <verse eid="REV 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2"/>Bi chanlase Hudai melie dolon qienxien beizho. Hhelade dolon laba ogizho.<verse eid="REV 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3"/>Da nie qienxien iredene antanni xianlu bareizhi sidagha gieku teizi kanzide beizho. Olon xianni hhende ogizhi shentulai onxianghala hhantu baozo kondedu antanni sidagha gieku teizi jiere ogine giezho. <verse eid="REV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4"/>Hhe xianni funi shentulai onxianghala hhantu qienxienni khase Hudai melie khireiwo. <verse eid="REV 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5"/>Ingie qienxien xianluni bareizhi sidagha gieku teizi jieredu khanni zhonlozhi durughadene zemin jiere kiese olien tunguliezho, fugie shenqi, shanjien, zemin gojioluzho.<verse eid="REV 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dolon Labai Zeinan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6"/>Dolon laba bareisan dolon qienxien feiliene giezhi zhunbei giezho. <verse eid="REV 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7"/>Ji 1 gie qienxien labani feiliese mendou, chusunghala huisan khan zemin jiere bouzhezho. Zeminni 3 fenzhi 1, mutunni 3 fenzhi 1 ni sidera widaghawo, pse noghon osunlai man sidera widaghawo.<verse eid="REV 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8"/>Ji 2 gie qienxien labani feiliese khan siderasan xianlitu fugie ulai haide bendawo. Haini 3 fenzhi 1 chusun gholuwo, <verse eid="REV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9"/>Haini amitu ojien 3 fenzhi 1 fuguwo, chonni 3 fenzhi 1 qida oluwo.<verse eid="REV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10"/>Ji 3 gie qienxien labani feiliese hoba mutun siderasan fugie hodun asimanse moron, bulai 3 fenzhi 1 de bouzhewo. <verse eid="REV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11"/>Ene hodunni nierei Kou giene. Usuni 3 fenzhi 1 kouni gholuwo. Usu koudase olon kunla fuguwo.<verse eid="REV 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12"/>Ji 4 gie qienxien labani feiliese naranni 3 fenzhi 1, sarani 3 fenzhi 1, hodunlai 3 fenzhi 1 ni eghizhi naran, sara, hodunlani 3 fenzhi 1 kharalawo. Uduni 3 fenzhi 1 de gon widawo, xieniye niekielien wo.<verse eid="REV 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13"/>Bi chanlazhi sonosuse asimande musisan nie in fugie shenqighala kieliezho, "Gou widawo! Gou widawo! Duyade sousan kunlade gou widawo! Da ghuran qienxien labani feiliene giezho!"<verse eid="REV 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1"/>Ji 5 gie qienxien labani feiliese bi chanlase nie hodun asimanse zemin jiere bouwo, jizi witu nokienni yeshii hhende ogizho. <verse eid="REV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2"/>Hhe nokienni niese funi ojiede mouizhi fugie luzini funii xianli. Ene funi naran, asimanni kharalaghawo. <verse eid="REV 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3"/>Machazi funise khizhedene zemin jiere luiwo. Hhelade nenli ogizhi hoxian zemin jieredu xiezini nenlii xianli. <verse eid="REV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4"/>Hhelade fenfulazhi zemin jieredu osunji yanyanji noghon dunxi, mutunlai bu shanjidene zinie manlou jiere Hudai zhanzii ese taisan kunlai shanji giezho. <verse eid="REV 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5"/>Hhelai bu alazhi tawun sara tendun shouigha giezho. Ene tendun xiezi kunyi jinjisan niekielien wo. <verse eid="REV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6"/>Hhezighan udude kun fugune giezhoma fugu dane. Fuguku duran biliuzhe fuguku hhelase piizho.<verse eid="REV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7"/>Machazini yanzi hoxian zhan eghindune giezhi zhunbei gie goudaghasan moreii xianli. Qiorun jiere zhosan antanni maghalai xianli, ungienni ere kunyi ungiei xianli, <verse eid="REV 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8"/>usunni biereini usunyi xianli, shidunni shizii shidunyi xianli. <verse eid="REV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9"/>Echan jiereni qiemu majiai xianlitu huiku majia wine. Hhelai sibanyini shenqi hoxian olon mache holuzhi zhanchan jiere khireiku shenqii xianli. <verse eid="REV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10"/>Hhelai xien xiezii xianli, xien jieredu duni kunyi tawun sara shanji shidane. <verse eid="REV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11"/>Jizi witu nokienni qienxien hhelade honshan danlazho. <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kielienghala kieliese niereini <char style="pn">Yabadun</char> giene, <char style="png">Xila</char> kielienghala <char style="pn">Yabolun</char> giene.<verse eid="REV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12"/>Ji 1 gie zeinan daowo. Uzhe, pse ghua zeinan irene.<verse eid="REV 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13"/>Ji 6 gie qienxien labani feiliese bi sonosuse nie shenqi Hudai meliedu antanni sidagha gieku teizii jieran gochase khizhezho. <verse eid="REV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14"/>Ene shenqi laba bareisan ji 6 gie qienxiende kieliezho, "<char style="png">Yufalaji</char> fugie moronde banlasan jieran qienxienni andagha." <verse eid="REV 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15"/>Ingie jieran qienxienni andaghawo. Hhela alinie hon, sara, udu, zhuntoude kunni 3 fenzhi 1 ni alakui zhunbei gie goudaghazho. <verse eid="REV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16"/>Bi shuzii sonosuse hhelade morei unusan budui lianyi wine. <verse eid="REV 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17"/>Bi zhoujin mutun hhezighan morei, morei unusanlai chanlawo. Morei unusanlai echan jiere huiku majia wine. Majiani yenshei khan mutun hulan, manou mutun kugie, liuhon mutun shira wo. Moreini qiorun shizini qiorunni xianli. Khan, funi, liuhon, moreini amanse khizhezho. <verse eid="REV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18"/>Amanseni khizhesan khan, funi, liuhon ene ghuran zeinanghala kunni 3 fenzhi 1 ni alawo. <verse eid="REV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19"/>Moreilai nenli amandeji xiende wo. Xienni mogheini xianli, qiorun bizhi qiorunghala kunni heine.<verse eid="REV 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20"/>Enezighan zeinanghala ese alasan psedu kunla goya khaghalane giesanne geizhen ese giedene da sheitanlai, pse hhezighan uzhe daku, sonosu daku, yo daku, antan, miengu, tun, tashi, muzhaghala giesan nigiedalai beiizho. <verse eid="REV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21"/>Hhela kun alaku, fashu shuaiku, lon kijieku, ghulaku shiqinlasene geizhen ese giezho.<verse eid="REV 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10"/>
  <para style="s">Qienxien Horosan Ga Shughala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1"/>Bi pse chanlase dou nie fugie liliantu qienxien asimanse bouzhezhi olienni nanbezho, qiorun jiereni lun sulasan wine, ungienni naranni xianli, ghua konni khantu tuhuai xianli. <verse eid="REV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2"/>Hhei khade keighasan ga shu wine. Borun konni haini taizho, soghei konni zeminni taizho. <verse eid="REV 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3"/>Fugie shenqighala waradase hoxian shizi onghonosei xianli. Waradakude dolon olien tunguliesan shenqi khizhezho. <verse eid="REV 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4"/>Dolon olien tunguliesan shenqi khizhekude bi hhei huaine giezho. Ingiekude bi sonosuse asimanse shenqi kieliezhi dolon olien tunguliesan kieliesei bu huaidene fenji giezho. <verse eid="REV 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5"/>Bi chanlasan hai, zeminni taisan qienxien asimande borun khane zhadeighadene <verse eid="REV 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6"/>zhiizhi asiman, asiman jieredu ojien, zemin, zemin jieredu ojien, hai, hai dundadu ojienlai zhayaghasan chanqi izhi amituku hhende fayen giezhi kieliezho, "Pse danwu ulie giene. <verse eid="REV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7"/>Ji 7 gie qienxien labani feiliekude Hudai mimi Huda xienzhi hojiladene chonjizhi ogisan gouxioxi mutun chenjine."<verse eid="REV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8"/>Bi melieshi asimanse sonosusan shenqi pse made kieliewo, "Chi echidene hai, zeminni taisan qienxienni khase keighasan shuni agi." <verse eid="REV 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9"/>Bi qienxienyi hhende yo dao horosan ga shuni made ogi giezhi kieliewo. Hhe made kieliewo, "Chi bareidene ijie agi. Kielidechii koudanema, amandechii qiende shimei niekielien wo." <verse eid="REV 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10"/>Bi qienxienyi khase ga shuni jienlie daozhedene ijie agise mii amande zhenzhenji qiende shimei niekielien wo, kielidemi kou wo. <verse eid="REV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11"/>Pse made kieliezho, "Chi olon minzu, gojia, yanyanji kielienyi kieliechen kun, honshanlai fanmiende kieliesan Hudai kielienyi indan pse kieliekuni wo."<verse eid="REV 10:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ghua Ganzhen Beisan Kun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1"/>Made nie zhugunyi xianlitu chizii ogizhi kieliezho, "Bosizhedene Hudai dajien, sidagha gieku teizi, pse hhende libai giesan kunlai nanji. <verse eid="REV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2"/>Dajienni ghadanedu yenzii bu nanji, hhei niman kunlade ogizho. Hhela zhiguitu chenshini 42 gie sara tai pindaghane. <verse eid="REV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3"/>Bi ghua ganzhen beisan kundene madei jien musighazhi qienli ogidene 1260 qien Hudai daolini kielieghane."<verse eid="REV 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4"/>Hhelashi duyai Ezhanyi melie beisan ghua ganlan mutun, ghua zhula teizi wo. <verse eid="REV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5"/>Kien hhelai heine giese hhelai amanse khan khizhezhi duitoulai sidera widaghane. Hhelai heine giesanlai kenjin ingiezhi alane. <verse eid="REV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6"/>Ene ghualade Hudai kielienyi kielieku udude asimanni menjighadene ghura ulie boughaku nenli wine. Pse usulai chusun gholughazhi da goyane isizhe yanyanji zeinanghala duyai eghiku nenli wine. <verse eid="REV 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7"/>Hhela ganzhen bei balukude jizi witu nokiense khizhesan yewo hhelare eghinduzhi injidene hhelai alane. <verse eid="REV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8"/>Hhelani fugusan beyeni fugie chenshini geidoude jiene. Ene chenshini bilazhi kieliese <char style="png">Sodoma</char>ye giene, <char style="png">Aiji</char>ye giene, jiushi hhelai Ezhanni shizijia jiere ghada alasan oron wo. <verse eid="REV 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9"/>Go minzu, go pai, go kielien, go gojialase iresan kunla hhelai fugusan beyei ghurudu zharun xihan uzhezhi mezade ulie teighane. <verse eid="REV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10"/>Ene ghua xienzhila zemin jiere sousan kunlai tendun shouighazhi daozho, ingiese zemin jiere sousan kunla hhela fugusande bayasuzhi nieniedene mure khughone.<verse eid="REV 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11"/>Ghurudu zharun daodene amin bitu ho Hudai hhense hhelai sudoro orose hhela bosizhewo. Hhelai chanlasan kunla hende ayizho. <verse eid="REV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12"/>Ghua xienzhi sonosuse asimanse fugie shenqi hhelade kieliezho, "Enende khizhe." Hhela olienre hhantu asimande khiwo. Duitoulaniye chanlawo. <verse eid="REV 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13"/>Zhen ingiekude zemin hende gojioluzhi chenshini 10 fenzhi 1 tairezho. Zemin gojioluzhi fugusan kun 7000 gie wo. Feiliesan kunla ayizhi kuaikui asiman jieredu Hudade ogizho.<verse eid="REV 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14"/>Ji 2 gie zeinan daowo. Uzhe, ji 3 gie zeinan deigo irene.<verse eid="REV 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ji 7 Gie Labani Feiliezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15"/>Ji 7 gie qienxien labani feiliese asimande fugie shenqila bizhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">"Duyani gojia mai Ezhanji hhe teisan Mexihani gojia gholuwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">Hhe chanqi izhi honshan danlane."<verse eid="REV 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16"/>Hudai melie goya wizide sousan 24 gie zhanlao papaladene Hudai beiizhi <verse eid="REV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17"/>kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">"Edeku, eqighanku Ezhan, nenlitu Huda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">bijien chade mafan kielieye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Chi fugie nenli bareizhi honshan danlawo.<verse eid="REV 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18"/>Gojiala noiwoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">chii hokuku irewo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Fugusan kunni panjiku shihou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">chii hoji, xienzhi, shentu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">jien chii jilasan kun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">fugiei gajiniji jianli linlaku shihou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Pse duyani pohai giesanlai chi widaghaku shihou irewo."<verse eid="REV 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19"/>Ingiekude asimandedu Hudai dajien keizhi sudoroni kielien yenjisan xianzini uzhe shidane. Pse shanjien, fugie shenqi, olien tunguliesan, zemin gojiolusan, fugie mendou wine.<verse eid="REV 11:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12"/>
  <para style="s">Bierei Lunghala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1"/>Asimande fugie zunji xienjizhi nie bierei naranni musizhi sarani taizho. Qiorun jierene 12 gie hoduntu honshan zhoku maghala zhozho. <verse eid="REV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2"/>Hhe kewosi laizhi olukude otuzhi tendun shouizhi waradazho. <verse eid="REV 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3"/>Asimande pse nie zunji xienjizhi nie hulan lunde dolon qiorun, hharan gocha wo. Dolon qiorun jiereni dolon honshan zhoku ga maghala zhozho. <verse eid="REV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4"/>Hhe xienghalane asimanni hodunlai 3 fenzhi 1 ni laizhi zemin jiere bendawo. Pse kewosi olune giesan biereini melie beidene hhe oluse hhei kewosii ijiene giezho. <verse eid="REV 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5"/>Bierei nie kewon oluwo. Ene kewon jianlai qiemu zhugunghala gojialai man gonjine. Hheni kewosii Hudai baozoi hhende qila echiwo. <verse eid="REV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6"/>Bierei hontande holuzhi echise Huda hhei hhende 1260 qien qiezhene giezhi zhunbei giesan oron wine.<verse eid="REV 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7"/>Asiman jiere zhan eghindu qiiwo. <char style="pn">Mijiale</char> qienxienlarene lunghala eghinduzhi lunye kha douradedularene hhantu bosizhezhi eghinduzho. <verse eid="REV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8"/>Lun inji dase asiman jiere hhelade oron widazho. <verse eid="REV 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9"/>Fugie lunshi gushihouni moghei wo, niereini Sheitan giene, pse Ibilisiye giene. Duyade sousan kunlai man miizho. Hhei zemin jiere bendawo, hhei kha douradedulaiye hhantu bendawo. <verse eid="REV 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10"/>Bi sonosuse asimanse fugie shenqi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">"Ede mai Hudai jiuiku, nenli, gojia irezho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">hhe teisan Mexiha qienli bareizho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Mai Hudai melie xieni uduji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">mai gaijiulai zhasan hhei benda boughawo.<verse eid="REV 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11"/>Gaijiula lunni injikushi ghoni ghughanyi chusun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">pse goyalane ganzhen beisan daolighala wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Hhela amindene ulie orezhi fugukude kuzho.<verse eid="REV 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12"/>Ingiese asiman, pse hhende sousanla bayasundu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Zemin, haide gou widawo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">Ibilisi goyade shihou oloncha widakui mejiedene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Hende hokuzhi tai hhende bouwo."<verse eid="REV 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13"/>Lun goyai zemin jiere bendasei mejiedene kewon olusan biereini fenjiezhi biizho. <verse eid="REV 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14"/>Ingiese fugie inni ghua sibanni biereide ogise hhe musidene mogheise piizhi hontanni goya orondene echiwo. Hhende biereini nie shihou, ghua shihou, olie shihou qiezhezho. <verse eid="REV 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15"/>Moghei biereini khuinase amansene moron mutun usuni nunpuzhi biereini chunji yolaghane giezho. <verse eid="REV 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16"/>Zemin biereide banman giezhi amanne keighadene lun amansene nunpusan usuni yenjiwo. <verse eid="REV 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17"/>Lun biereide hokudene biereini psedu kesilare eghindule echizho. Ene kesilashi Hudai minlinyi zunjizhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de ganzhen beisanla wo. <verse eid="REV 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18"/>Qingiekude lun haibienzini shazi jiere beizho.<verse eid="REV 12:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ghua Yewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1"/>Bi chanlase nie yewo haise khizhezhi hharan gocha, dolon qiorun wine. Hharan gocha jierene hharan honshan zhoku ga maghala zhozho. Dolon qiorun jiereni Hudai sugieku niere wine. <verse eid="REV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2"/>Bi chanlasan yewo laohuni xianli, konni gouxinni konni xianli, amanni shizini amanni xianli. Lun goya nenli, wizi, fugie qienline hhende ogiwo. <verse eid="REV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3"/>Bi chanlase yewoni dolon qiorun dunda niekozi hoxian fuguku shan deilazhoma goudazho. Zemin jieredula man ghanirazhi yewoni daghazho. <verse eid="REV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4"/>Hhela lunni beiikushi lun qienline yewode ogizho. Pse yewoni beiizhi kieliezho, "Kien ene yewoghala bilane, kien hheghala eghindu shidane?"<verse eid="REV 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5"/>Yewode tungulieku, Hudai sugieku aman ogizho. Pse 42 gie sara durare gieku qienli ogizho. <verse eid="REV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6"/>Yewo amanne keighazhi Hudai sugieku kielien kieliezho. Hudai nierei, hhei zhanfan, jiushi asiman jiere sousanlai sugiezho. <verse eid="REV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7"/>Pse shentulare eghinduzhi injiku dainni jienliezhi go pai, go minzu, go kielien, go gojialai hanshilieku qienlini jienliezho. <verse eid="REV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8"/>Jien zemin jiere sousan, niereini duyai zhayaghasanse alasan ghoni ghughanyi aminni jilasan benzi jiere ese jilasan kunla man hhei beiine.<verse eid="REV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9"/>Chighin bitu kunla chenliendu!<verse eid="REV 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10"/>Qianla echiku kunyi kenjin qianla echine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Khudoghoghala alaku kunyi kenjin khudoghoghala alane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">Ingiese shentulade bixi rennai, xianxin gieku bikui wo.<verse eid="REV 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11"/>Bi chanlase da nie yewo zeminse khizhezhi ghua gocha bisan ghoni ghughanyi xianli, kielien kieliese lunni xianli. <verse eid="REV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12"/>Hhe tou 1 gie yewoni nenlini hhei melie man khizheghazhi zemin, zemin jiere sousanlai, fuguku shanni goudaghasan tou 1 gie yewoni beiighazho. <verse eid="REV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13"/>Pse fugie ghudureqilai giezhi da kunlai melie khanni asimanse zeminde bouzheghazho. <verse eid="REV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14"/>Ene yewo qienlini jienliedene tou 1 gie yewoni melie ghudureqilai giezhi zemin jiere sousan kunlai miizho. Pse khudoghoghala shan deiladene ese fugusan yewode nie nigieda gie giezhi hhelade kieliezho. <verse eid="REV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15"/>Hhe nenlini jienliedene nigiedade ho ogizhi kielien kielieghazho, pse soyuji nigiedai ese beiisan kunlai man alaghazho.<verse eid="REV 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16"/>Pse soyuji kunlai bugon fugiei, gajii, nanxinyi, bayanyi, hoji ese danlasan, hoji danlasanlai borun kha jiere onu manlou jiere zhanzi taighadene <verse eid="REV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17"/>zhanzi uwochenlai meimei ese gieghazho. Ene zhanzishi yewoni niere, pseshi yewoni nierei daibio giesan shuzi wo. <verse eid="REV 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18"/>Enende agheli kerene. Jienzha kun ene yewoni shuzii sana khizhegha. Ene shuzi nie kunni nierei daibio giezho, 666 wo.<verse eid="REV 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14"/>
  <para style="s">144000 Kunni Don</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1"/>Bi chanlase ghoni ghughan <char style="png">Xiwunshan</char>de beizhi 144000 kun hhere hhantu wo! Hhelai manlou jiere hhei nierei, adaini nierei huaizho. <verse eid="REV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2"/>Bi sonosuse asimanse iresan shenqi hoxian olon usuni shenqi, fugie olien tunguliesan shenqii xianli. Bi sonosusan shenqi hoxian qin tanjisan kunla tanjisan shenqii xianli. <verse eid="REV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3"/>Hhela baozo melie pse jieran amitu ojien, zhanlaolai melie shini don doulazho. Zemin jierese shuizhi iresan 144000 kunse chugo kiemada ene donni suru dane. <verse eid="REV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4"/>Enezighan kunla biereini shighazhi ese daozho, biereilare kijiezhi ese daozho. Ghoni ghughan khala echise hhela hhei daghazho. Hhelashi kun dundase shuizhi iredene Hudaji ghoni ghughonde ogisan tou 1 ban kun wo. <verse eid="REV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5"/>Hhelai amanse ghudan ereizhi olu dane, hhelade jienjien goujida uwo.<verse eid="REV 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ghuran Qienxien Chonjisan Xioxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6"/>Bi chanlase da nie qienxien asimande musizhi zemin jiere sousan go gojia, go pai, go kielien, minzulade chonjiku chanqiku gouxioxii bareizho. <verse eid="REV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7"/>Hhe fugie shenqighala kieliezho, "Hudai zunji! Kuaikui hhende ogi! Hhe panjiku shihou kuzhezho. Asiman, zemin, hai, bulai zhayaghasei beii!"<verse eid="REV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8"/>Pse nie qienxien irezhi kieliezho, "Soyuji gojialade lon kijiezhi hokukui ireghasan <char style="png">Babilun</char> fugie chenshi furawo, furawo!"<verse eid="REV 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9"/>Pse nie, jiushi ji 3 gie qienxien irezhi fugie shenqighala kieliezho, "Kien yewo, hhei yanzii beiizhi manlou jiere, kha jiere zhanzi taise <verse eid="REV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10"/>kienye Hudai hokukui shouine. Huda zui fugiede hokukune ireghane. Ene kunla zhiguitu qienxien, ghoni ghughanyi melie khan, liuhon dunda tendun shouine. <verse eid="REV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11"/>Hhela tendun shouisan funi chanqi izhi ojiede mouizho. Hhezighan yewo, yewoni nigiedai beiizhi hhei niereni zhanzii taisanlade udu xieniji nanran uwo."<verse eid="REV 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12"/>Ingiese Hudai minlinyi zunjizhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin gieku bisan shentulade bixi rennai bikui wo.<verse eid="REV 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13"/>Bi sonosuse asimande shenqi bizhi kieliezho, "Enedu khuinashi Ezhanni miende fugusan kunlade fuqi wine giezhi chi huai." Ingiese Shenlin kieliezho, "Enbene, hhela khishulasansene xiine, giesande huibao wine."<verse eid="REV 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duya Barakude Ghuraku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14"/>Bi pse chanlase niegieda chighan olien wo! Olien jiere hoxian kunni kewon souzhi qiorun jierene honshan zhoku antanni maghala zhozho, khadene xidu liendao bareizho. <verse eid="REV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15"/>Pse nie qienxien dajiense khizhezhi olien jiere sousande fugie shenqighala waradazhi kieliezho, "Ghuraku shihou kuruzho. Zemin jieredu zhonjiala bolu momoreizho. Liendaoghalane ghura!" <verse eid="REV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16"/>Ingiese olien jiere sousan liendaoghalane nie ghaduliese zemin jiereshiku zhonjiani ghurawo.<verse eid="REV 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17"/>Pse nie qienxien asiman jieredu Hudai dajiense khizhezhi xidu liendaoye bareizho. <verse eid="REV 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18"/>Pse nie qienxien sidagha gieku teizise khizhezhi nenli bizhi khanni gonjizho. Xidu liendao bareisande fugie shenqighala waradazhi kieliezho, "Putou bolu momoreizho. Xidu liendaoghalane ghaduliezhi zemin jieredu putoui ghura." <verse eid="REV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19"/>Hhe qienxien liendaoghalane ghaduliezhi zemin jiereshiku putouni ghuradene Hudai hokuku fugie jiu gieku chizide bendawo. <verse eid="REV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20"/>Chenshi ghadane jiu gieku chizide putouni taizho. Hhense chusun usuruzhi khizhezhi undude morei ghada undu wo, gholode 1600 sitaji wo.<verse eid="REV 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15"/>
  <para style="s">Zuihouku Zeinanni Bareisan Dolon Qienxien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1"/>Bi pse chanlase asimande da nie zunji wine. Fugie, ghudure no wo. Dolon qienxien dolon zeinanni bareizho. Eneshi zuihouku zeinan wo. Hudai hokuku eneghala barane.<verse eid="REV 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2"/>Bi chanlase khan huisan boli mutun hai wine. Yewo, yewoni nigieda, yewoni nierei daibio giesan shuzise injisan kunla boli hai jiere beizhi Hudai qinni bareidene <verse eid="REV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3"/>Hudai hoji <char style="pn">Musa</char>i don, ghoni ghughanyi donni doulazhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">"Ezhan Huda, fugie nenlituya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">chii gieku fama wo, ghudure wo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Soyuji gojiani honshanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">chii mo gundan wo, zhen wo!<verse eid="REV 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4"/>Ezhan, zinie chishi zhiguitu wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Kien chii ulie zunjizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">chii nierei ulie kuaine?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Soyuji gojiala irezhi chii beiikushi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">chi gundande giekune khizheghazho."<verse eid="REV 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5"/>Enense khuinashi bi chanlase asiman jiere dajien keizho. Eneshi ganzhen beiku zhanfan wo. <verse eid="REV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6"/>Dajiense dolon zeinanni gonjisan dolon qienxien khizhewo. Ganjin, gieghantu gou jien musizhi echan jierene antanni popu banlazho. <verse eid="REV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7"/>Jieran amitu ojien dundadu niekozi chanqi izhi amituku Hudai hokukui zhonlozhi durughasan dolon antanni ighai dolon qienxiende ogiwo. <verse eid="REV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8"/>Hudai fama, nenlighala dajiende funi duruzho. Dolon qienxien dolon zeinanni bouzhezhi baraghatula kiema dajiende oro dane.<verse eid="REV 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16"/>
  <para style="s">Hudani Ho Kuruku Igha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1"/>Bi sonosuse dajiense fugie shenqi khizhezhi dolon qienxiende kieliezho, "Ta echidene Hudai hokuku dolon ighai zeminde pojie."<verse eid="REV 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2"/>Ji 1 gie qienxien echidene ighani zeminde pojiese yewoni zhanzi taisan, yewoni nigiedai beiisanlai beye jiere zannan, du yara khizhezho.<verse eid="REV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3"/>Ji 2 gie qienxien ighani haide pojiese hai fugusan kunni chusun mutun gholuwo. Haini amitu ojienla man fuguwo.<verse eid="REV 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4"/>Ji 3 gie qienxien ighani moron, bulade pojiese usu chusun gholuwo. <verse eid="REV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5"/>Bi sonosuse usuni gonjisan qienxien kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">"Eqighanku, edeku zhiguitu Huda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">chi ingiezhi panjise gundan wo.<verse eid="REV 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6"/>Hhela shentu, xienzhilai chusunyi usurughazhi daozho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">Ede chi hhelade chusun ochighazho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">Ingiezhi giese hhelade indanji wo!"<verse eid="REV 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7"/>Bi pse sonosuse sidagha gieku teizise shenqi bizhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">"Enbene, Ezhan Huda, fugie nenlituya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">chii panjiku zhen wo, gundan wo!"<verse eid="REV 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8"/>Ji 4 gie qienxien ighani naran nudunde pojiese nanran kunni khanghala kouine. <verse eid="REV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9"/>Kunlai hende hhereide kouise nenli bizhi zeinanni gonjisan Hudai nierei sugiezhi, da geizhen ulie giezhi kuaikui Hudade ulie ogine.<verse eid="REV 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10"/>Ji 5 gie qienxien ighani yewoni zowide pojiese yewoni gojia kharalawo. Kunla tendun shouizhi shidunne zhouzho. <verse eid="REV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11"/>Tendun shouiku, yara khizheku yenyinghala hhela asiman jieredu Hudai sugiezhi da giesansene geizhen ulie giene.<verse eid="REV 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12"/>Ji 6 gie qienxien ighani <char style="png">Yufalaji</char> fugie moronde pojiese moron ghozhi dunbangiese iresan honshanlade mo zhunbei giezho. <verse eid="REV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13"/>Bi pse chanlase baghai xianlitu ghuran zannan ruhher lun, yewo, jia xienzhilai amanse khizhezho. <verse eid="REV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14"/>Hhelashi sheitanni ruhher wo, ghudureqi gie shidane, duyani honshanlai hhende echizhi hhelai Fugie Nenlitu Hudai famatu udude hhantulaghazhi eghindughane giezho. <verse eid="REV 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15"/>Uzhe, bi ghughei mutun irene. Jinxin giezhi jienne musisan kunde fuqi wine. Hulan muchughun ulie yozhi shizhekune ulie uzheghane. <verse eid="REV 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16"/>Hhe zannan ruhherla honshanlai nie oronde hhantulaghazho, ene oronni <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kielienghala <char style="png">Hamagiedun</char> giene.<verse eid="REV 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17"/>Ji 7 gie qienxien ighani asimande pojiese fugie shenqi dajiendedu baozo jierese khizhezhi kieliezho, "Chenjiwo!" <verse eid="REV 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18"/>Ingiese shanjien, shenqi, olien tunguliesan, fugiede zemin gojioluku wine. Imutu fugie yenzhunde zemin gojioluku kun zemin jiere bisanse uwo. <verse eid="REV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19"/>Hhe fugie chenshi ghaluzhi ghuran gholuzhi go gojialani chenshilaye man furawo. Huda <char style="png">Babilun</char> fugie chenshini sumula iredene goya hokukune hhei jiere bouzheghawo. <verse eid="REV 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20"/>Go haini daola piizhi ulalaiye chanla dane. <verse eid="REV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21"/>Pse fugie mendoula asimanse kunyi jiere bouzhezhi niekozi gundude 70 jin wo. Ene mendouni zeinan hende fugieshi kunla Hudai sugiezho.<verse eid="REV 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17"/>
  <para style="s">Fugie Biozi Yewoghala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1"/>Dolon ighai bareisan dolon qienxien dundadu niekozi made kieliezho, "Chi ire, olon usu jiere sousan fugie biozini faikui bi chade uzheghaye. <verse eid="REV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2"/>Zemin jieredu honshanla hhere kijiezhi daozho, zemin jiere sousan kunla biozini lon kijieku jiuni ochizhi sudozho." <verse eid="REV 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3"/>Shenlin mii zhughei gojiolughazhi qienxien mii uduruzhi hontande echise nie bierei dahunse yewo jiere unusei bi chanlawo. Hhe yewode dolon qiorun, hharan gocha wo, hunshendeni Hudai sugieku niere wine. <verse eid="REV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4"/>Hhe bierei zishei, dahunseni jien musizhi antan, boushi, zhenzhughala dabalazho. Khadene antanni beizi bareizho. Beizide hanzhan gieghaku, lon kijieku zannannii zhonlo durughazho. <verse eid="REV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5"/>Manlou jiereni fugie <char style="png">Babilun</char> wo, zeminni biozila, yanyanji hanzhan gieghakulani Ana wo giezhi mimitu niere huaizho. <verse eid="REV 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6"/>Bi pse chanlase hhe bierei shentulani chusun, <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de oluzhi ganzhen beisan kunlai chusunyi ochi sudozho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Bi hhei chanlase hende ghanirazho. <verse eid="REV 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7"/>Qienxien made kieliezho, "Chi yale ghanirazho? Bi ene biereini, pse hhei achisan dolon qiorun hharan gochatu yewoni mimii chade kielieye. <verse eid="REV 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8"/>Chi chanlasan yewo eqighandei wine, ede uwo, jianlai jizi witu nokiense khizhezhi widakude echine. Jien zemin jiere sousanla, jiushi niereini duyai zhayaghasanse aminni jilasan benzi jiere ese jilasanla hhe eqighandei wine, ede uwo, jianlai ireku yewoni chanlase ghanirane. <verse eid="REV 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9"/>Enende aghelitu zhughe kerene. Hhe dolon qiorunshi bierei sousan dolon ula wo, dolon honshan wo. <verse eid="REV 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10"/>Tawulie ijin furawo, niekozi da wine, da nie dou ese irezhoma, irese goujicha beine. <verse eid="REV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11"/>Eqighandei biku, ede uwoku yewoshi ji 8 gie honshan wo, yeshi dololie mutun nie wo, widakude echine. <verse eid="REV 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12"/>Chi chanlasan hharan gochashi hharan honshan wo. Hhela dou gojiani sou dazhoma, niecha jiere yewore hhantu honshan danlaku qienli bareine. <verse eid="REV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13"/>Hhela nie zhugheghala goya nenli, qienline yewode ogizho. <verse eid="REV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14"/>Hhela ghoni ghughanre eghindune. Ghoni ghughan hhelase injikushi ghoni ghughanshi ezhan dundadu Ezhan wo, honshan dundadu Honshan wo. Hhezighan urusan, sunghusan, shixinji giesan kunlaye ghoni ghughanre hhantu injine."<verse eid="REV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15"/>Qienxien pse made kieliezho, "Chi chanlasan biozi sousan usushi olon minzu, bexin, gojia, kielien wo. <verse eid="REV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16"/>Chi chanlasan hharan gocha, yewo hhe biozini henjine. Hhei yanyanjilai qianlazhi hulan muchughun gholughadene mighaini ijiezhi khanghala sidera widaghane. <verse eid="REV 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17"/>Ingiekushi Huda hhelai zhughede goyane isii gieghakui teizho. Hhela nie zhugheghala goya gojialane yewode ogizhi Hudai kielien man gholuku shihou kune. <verse eid="REV 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18"/>Chi chanlasan biereishi zemin jieredu honshanlani gonjisan fugie chenshi wo."<verse eid="REV 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18"/>
  <para style="s">Babilun Furawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1"/>Enense khuinashi bi chanlase nie fugie nenlitu qienxien asimanse bouzhezho, hhei fama zemin jiere gon zhouizho. <verse eid="REV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2"/>Hhe fugie shenqighala waradazhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">"<char style="png">Babilun</char> fugie chenshi furawo, furawo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Sheitan souku oron gholuwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">Yanyanji zannan ruhherni ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">yanyanji zannan bunzhuni galun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">yanyanji zannan, hanzhan gieghaku yewoni oron gholuwo.<verse eid="REV 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3"/>Soyuji gojiala hhei lon kijieku fugie nefuxinde sudozho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">Zemin jieredu honshanla hhere kijiezhi daozho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Hhe gofenji baer lon huaise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">zemin jieredu meimei giechen kunla facai giewo."<verse eid="REV 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4"/>Bi pse sonosuse asimanse da nie shenqi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">"Mii bexinla, hhe chenshise khizhe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Pse hhere hhantu zui bizhi hhe shouiku zeinanni shouine.<verse eid="REV 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5"/>Hhei zui zemin jiere duruzhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">Huda hhei codasanyi ese matazho.<verse eid="REV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6"/>Hhe kunlade matugie giese hhendeye qingiezhi gie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Zhao hhe giesande shonbeide kharulu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Hhe huighasan jiuni beizide shonbeide huighadene hhende ogizhi chenfa gie.<verse eid="REV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7"/>Hhe goyane matugie kuaizhi matugie gofende baerni lon huaizhoshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">hheiye qingiezhi tendun shouighazhi nango giegha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Hhe zhughedene kieliezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">bi honshan mutun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">wizide souzhi guafu pusho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Zhughede yama nango gieku uwo giezho.<verse eid="REV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8"/>Ingiese hhei zeinanla man niudude irene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">Jiushi fuguku, nango gieku, oliesuku wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Hhei khanghala sidera widaghane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">Hhei panjiku Ezhan Hudade fugie nenli wine."<verse eid="REV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9"/>Hhere hhantu lon kijiezhi gofende lon baer huaisan zemin jieredu honshanla hhei tuliesan funii chanladene hhende oluzhi hende wilane. <verse eid="REV 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10"/>Hhela hhe tendun shouisanse ayizhi gholode beidene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">"Gou widawo! Gou widawo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">
    <char style="png">Babilun</char> fugie, famatu chenshiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Niecha jiere chii faiku irewo."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:10">giezhi kieliene.<verse eid="REV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11"/>Zemin jieredu meimei giesan kunla hhende oluzhi hende wilakushi hhelai dunxilai agichen kun pse widawo. <verse eid="REV 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12"/>Ene dunxilashi antan, miengu, boushi, zhenzhu, gou bosi, zisheini seiliu, donzi, dahunseni seiliu, yanyanji xian winetu mutun, daxianni shidunghala giesan yanyanji dunxi, guizhuntu mutun, tun, qiemu, guizhuntu tashighala giesan yanyanji dunxi, <verse eid="REV 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13"/>rougui, doukou, xian, xianshui, andatu osun, jiu, tosun, ghurun, boudei, fughe, ghoni, morei, mache, pse hoji wo. <verse eid="REV 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14"/>Meimei giesan kunla kieliezho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">"<char style="png">Babilun</char>ya, chi oresan dunxila man widawo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:14">Chii yanyanji seighan, gou dunxila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:14">chii dundase widazhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:14">pse chanla dane!"<verse eid="REV 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15"/>Hhe chenshide meimei giezhi facai giesan kunla hhe tendun shouisanse ayizhi gholode beidene hende wilazhi kieliezho,<verse eid="REV 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16"/>"Gou widawo! Gou widawo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">Ene fugie chenshiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">Yenlai zishei, dahunni gou jienni musizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">antan, boushi, zhenzhughala dabalazho.<verse eid="REV 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17"/>Niecha jiere imekie bayannila wida khiwo!"</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:17">Jien chonzhan, chon sousan kun, chon jiere wilie giesan, soyuji haini kouizhi udu daosanla gholode beizhi <verse eid="REV 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18"/>hhei tuliesan funii chanladene waradazhi kieliezho, "Yan chenshi ene chenshise fama wo?" <verse eid="REV 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19"/>Hhela pse turani qiorun jierene teidene hende wilazhi waradazhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">"Gou widawo! Gou widawo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">Ene fugie chenshiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Jien hai jiere yosan chonla hhei bayanni kouizhi bayazhezho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">Hhe niecha jiere hontan gholuwo.<verse eid="REV 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20"/>Asimanya, shentu, shitu, xienzhilaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">ta man hhei yenyinzhe bayasundu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Huda tande oluzhi hhei panjiwo!"<verse eid="REV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21"/>Nie fugie liliantu qienxien nie fugie qiemansha mutun tashini qila haide bendadene kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">"<char style="png">Babilun</char> fugie chenshini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ingiezhi hende benda boughase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">pse chanla dane.<verse eid="REV 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22"/>Qin tanjisan, don doulasan, xiu feiliesan, laba feiliesan shenqini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">chii dunda pse sonosu dane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Yanyanji mujianlai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">chii dunda ereizhi olu dane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Qieman sidasan shenqini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">chii dunda sonosu dane.<verse eid="REV 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23"/>Zhulani gon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">chii dunda pse ulie zhouine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Shini khughon, shini biereini shenqii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">pse chii dunda sonosu dane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Chare meimei giesan kunla yenlaishi duya jieredu zui henni wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">Soyuji gojialai chii fashu miizhi daozho.<verse eid="REV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24"/>Xienzhi, shentu, da zemin jieredu soyuji alasan kunlai chusunni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">ene chenshise ereizhi oluwo."<verse eid="REV 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1"/>Enense khuinashi bi sonosuse hoxian olon kunla asiman jiere fugie shenqighala kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">"Haliluya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="em">Hudade doula </char> </note>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:1">Jiuiku, kuaiku, nenlishi mai Hudanughun wo.<verse eid="REV 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2"/>Hhei panjiku zhenni wo, gundan wo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">Lon kijiezhi duyani qida olughasan fugie biozini panjiwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Hojilaini chusunni usurughasan biozini panjizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">hhelade bouchou giewo!"<verse eid="REV 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3"/>Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">"Haliluya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">Biozini tuliesan funi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">chanqi izhi mouizho."<verse eid="REV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4"/>24 gie zhanlao, jieran amitu ojienla baozo sousan Hudade papaladene beiizhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">"Amine! Haliluya!"<verse eid="REV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ghoni Ghughanni Ghurun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5"/>Pse shenqi baozose khizhezhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">"Hudai hojila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">jien hhei zunjisan fugiei, gajii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">man mai Hudade doula!"<verse eid="REV 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6"/>Bi pse sonosuse hoxian olon kunlai shenqi, olon usuni shenqi, fugie olien tunguliesan shenqi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">"Haliluya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Ezhan mai Huda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">Hhe Fugie Nenlitu manlai gonjizho.<verse eid="REV 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7"/>Matan hende bayasuzhi kuaikui hhende ogiye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">Ghoni ghughan ghurun ijieku shihou kuzhewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Shini biereini zhunbei gie goudawo.<verse eid="REV 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8"/>Gieghan, ganjintu gou jienni hhende ogizhi musighawo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">Ene gou jienshi shentula giesan gou wilie wo."<verse eid="REV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9"/>Qienxien made kieliezho, "Chi ingiezhi huai, 'Ghoni ghughanyi ghurunde xinlazhi iresan kunlade fuqi wine.'" Pse made kieliezho, "Eneshi Hudai shuhuajia kielien wo." <verse eid="REV 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10"/>Ingie bi hhei kon konde papaladene hhei beiine giese hhe kieliezho, "Ulie olune! Biye chighala, pse chii hhezighan Ersade ganzhen beisan gaijiulare hhantu hoji danlasan wo. Chi Hudai beii. Hudai kielienyi jianjiku dunda zui zhunyonishi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de ganzhen beiku wo."<verse eid="REV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chighan Morei Unuchen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11"/>Bi pse chanlase asiman keizhi nie chighan morei wo! Jiereni unusei Kekao, Zhenni giezhi uruzho. Hhe panjizhi eghinduse gundanghala giezho. <verse eid="REV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12"/>Nudunni khan giedai xianli, qiorun jierene honshan zhoku ga maghala olon zhozho. Jiereni hhense chugo kiema ulie mejieku niere huaizho. <verse eid="REV 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13"/>Hhe chusun xireighasan jienni musizho, niereini Hudai Kielien giene. <verse eid="REV 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14"/>Asiman jieredu buduila chighan, ganjintu gou jien musidene chighan morei unuzhi hhei daghazho. <verse eid="REV 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15"/>Amanseni xidu khudogho khizhezhi gojialani eghizhi beiighane. Qiemu zhugunghala hhelai gonjine, putou chizide jiu daruku mutun Fugie Nenlitu Hudai hokukui ireghane. <verse eid="REV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16"/>Hhei fudu jien jiere, datui jiere honshan dundadu Honshan, ezhan dundadu Ezhan giezhi niere huaizho.<verse eid="REV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17"/>Bi pse chanlase nie qienxien naran nudun dunda beizhi asiman jiere musisan soyuji bunzhulade fugie shenqighala waradazhi kieliezho, "Ta hhantuladene Hudai fugie xini soule ire. <verse eid="REV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18"/>Honshan, jianjin, lilian fugietu, morei, morei unusan, pse soyuji ziyutu, hoji danlasan, fugie, meilani kunlai mighai ijie." <verse eid="REV 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19"/>Bi pse chanlase yewo, zemin jieredu honshanla, pse hhelai buduila hhantuladene chighan morei unusan, da hhei buduilare eghindune giezho. <verse eid="REV 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20"/>Yewoni bareiwo. Pse yewore hhantuku jia xienzhiiye bareiwo. Jia xienzhi eqighandei yewoni melie ghudureqi giedene hhezighan yewoni zhanzii taizhi yewoni nigiedai beiisan kunlai miizho. Hhe ghualai amitu siderasan liuhonni khantu haide bendawo. <verse eid="REV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21"/>Psedulai morei unusei amanse khizhesan khudogho alawo. Soyuji bunzhula hhelai mighai ijie chuduwo.<verse eid="REV 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20"/>
  <para style="s">1000 Nien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1"/>Bi pse chanlase nie qienxien asimanse bouzhezhi khadeni jizi witu nokienni yeshi, fugie qielien wine. <verse eid="REV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2"/>Qienxien lunni bareiwo. Hheshi gushihouni moghei, sheitan, Ibilisi wo. Hhei 1000 nien banladene <verse eid="REV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3"/>jizi witu nokiende bendazhi nokienyi khadene fenjizhi 1000 nien kurutula gojialai pse ulie miighane. Ene shiqinla daose hhei bixi zhanshi jiere andaghane.<verse eid="REV 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4"/>Bi pse ezighan baozo, baozo jiere sousanlai chanlawo. Hhelade panjiku qienlii ogizho. Bi pse hhezighan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de ganzhen beizhi Hudai kieliende oluzhi qiorunni pienjisan kunlai ruhherni chanlawo. Hhelashi yewo, yewoni nigiedai ese beiizhi manlou kha jiereni zhanzi ese taisan kunla wo. Hhela aminne oluzhi Mexihare hhantu 1000 nien honshan danlawo. <verse eid="REV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5"/>Eneshi tou 1 hui fuho wo. Psedu kunla 1000 nien olutula aminne ese oluzho. <verse eid="REV 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6"/>Tou 1 hui fuhode guzi bichen kunlade fuqi bizhi zhiguitu wo. Ji 2 hui fuguku hhelai gonji dane. Hhela Huda, Mexihaghalade buwa danlazhi Mexihare hhantu 1000 nien honshan danlane.<verse eid="REV 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ibilisini Eghi Beiighaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7"/>1000 nien daose Ibilisini bafanzise andaghase <verse eid="REV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8"/>khizhedene zemin jieredu simienni gojialai miine. Ene gojialashi <char style="png">Gaoge</char>, <char style="png">Mage</char> wo. Hhelai hhantulaghazhi eghindughane giezho. Hhelai shuzi olonde haini shazi niekielien wo. <verse eid="REV 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9"/>Hhela khizhezhi nie zemin jiere dudene shentulani zhanfan, Huda oresan chenshini wiqise khan asimanse bouzhezhi hhelai sidera widaghawo. <verse eid="REV 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10"/>Hhelai miisan sheitanni liuhontu khantu haide bendawo. Hhende yewo, jia xienzhi wine. Hhela xieni uduji chanqi izhi tendun shouine.<verse eid="REV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihou Panjiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11"/>Bi pse nie chighan fugie baozo, baozo jiere sousanyi chanlawo. Hhei meliese asiman, zemin piizhi hhelai pse chanla dawo. <verse eid="REV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12"/>Bi pse chanlase fugusan kun gajii fugieiji baozo melie beizho. Shulani man keighawo. Da nie shuniye keighawo, hheshijiu aminni jilasan benzi wo. Fugusan kunlai zhao hhela giesanzhe shu jiere jilasan mutun panjine. <verse eid="REV 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13"/>Pse hai haide fugusan kunlai ogiwo. Fuguku, pse dozohei hhelai hhende fugusan kunlaiye ogiwo. Hhelai zhao hhelai giesan mutun panjine. <verse eid="REV 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14"/>Fuguku pse dozoheini khantu hude bendawo. Ene khantu hushi ji 2 hui fuguku wo. <verse eid="REV 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15"/>Kienyi niere aminni benzi jiere uwoshi hhei khantu hude bendawo.<verse eid="REV 20:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21"/>
  <para style="s">Shini Asiman Zemin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1"/>Bi pse shini asiman, zemin chanlawo. Eqighanku asiman, zemin widawo, haiye widawo. <verse eid="REV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2"/>Bi pse chanlase zhiguitu chenshi shini <char style="png">Yelusalen</char> asimanyi Hudai hhense bouzhezho. Hoxian shini bierei zhanguijidene oluzhi dabala goudasei xianli. <verse eid="REV 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3"/>Bi pse sonosuse fugie shenqi baozose khizhezhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 21:3">"Uzhe, Hudai zhanfan kun dunda wo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 21:3">Huda kunlare hhantu soune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 21:3">Hhela hhende bexin danlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 21:3">Huda qinsi hhelare hhantu wine.<verse eid="REV 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4"/>Hhelai nughunsunyi man saine.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 21:4">Pse fuguku uwo, pse nango gieku, wilaku, tendun uwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 21:4">Melieshidaku shiqinla daowo."<verse eid="REV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5"/>Baozo sousan kieliewo, "Uzhe, bi soyujilai shinishighazho." Pse kieliewo, "Chi huai, enezighan kielienshi kekao, zhenni wo." <verse eid="REV 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6"/>Hhe made pse kieliewo, "Chenjiwo! Bishi Alafa wo, Emeiga wo, jiushi keitou wo, baraku wo. Bi aminni bula usuni undasusan kunde belien ughane. <verse eid="REV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7"/>Injisan kunla enezighanyi jienliezhi caichan giene. Bi hhende Huda danlane, hhe made kewon danlane. <verse eid="REV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8"/>Danzi meilatu, xianxin ulie giechen, hanzhan gieghachen, kun alachen, lon kijiechen, fashu shuaichen, nigieda beiichen, da soyuji ghudan kieliechen kunlai guzi siderasan liuhontu khantu hude wo. Eneshi ji 2 hui fuguku wo."<verse eid="REV 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shini Yelusalen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9"/>Zuihouku dolon zeinanni zhonlo durughasan dolon antan ighani bareisan dolon qienxien dundadu nie made kieliewo, "Chi ire, bi chade shini biereii uzheghaye, ghoni ghughanyi bierei wo." <verse eid="REV 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10"/>Shenlin mii zhughei gojiolughazhi qienxien mii uduruzhi nie undu fugie ulade echi, asimanni Hudai hhense bouzhesan zhiguitu chenshi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni made uzheghawo. <verse eid="REV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11"/>Chenshide Hudai fama wine. Faisan gon guizhuntu boushi, ishini xianli, gieghantu shuijin niekielien wo. <verse eid="REV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12"/>Hhende fugie undu dan wine, 12 gie wijien wo. Wijien jiere 12 gie qienxien wine. Wijien jiere <char style="png">Isilie</char>ni 12 gie paini nierei huaizho. <verse eid="REV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13"/>Dunmiende ghuran wijien, beimiende ghuran wijien, nanmiende ghuran wijien, ximiende ghuran wijien wo. <verse eid="REV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14"/>Chenshini dande 12 gie jichu wo, jichu jiere ghoni ghughanyi 12 gie shituni niere wine.<verse eid="REV 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15"/>Made kielien kieliesan qienxien antanni ghulusunyi bareizhi chenshi, wijien, danni nanjine giezho. <verse eid="REV 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16"/>Chenshishi jieran mien wo, fudu, aghui niekielien wo. Qienxien ghulusunghala chenshini nanjise man 12000 sitaji wo. Fudu, aghui, unduni niekielien wo. <verse eid="REV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17"/>Hhe zhao kunni chicun, yeshijiu qienxienni chicunghala danni nanjise 144 zhou wo. <verse eid="REV 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18"/>Danshi ishighala giesan wo, chenshishi gou antanghala giesan wo, gieghande boli niekielien wo. <verse eid="REV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19"/>Danni jichui yanyanji boushighala dabalaghazho. Ji 1 gie jichushi ishi wo, ji 2 gieshi kugie boushi wo, ji 3 gieshi noghon manou wo, ji 4 gieshi noghon boushi wo, <verse eid="REV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20"/>ji 5 gieshi hulan manou wo, ji 6 gieshi hulan boushi wo, ji 7 gieshi shira boushi wo, ji 8 gieshi noghon ishi wo, ji 9 gieshi shira ishi wo, ji 10 gieshi feicui wo, ji 11 gieshi zishei manou wo, ji 12 gieshi zishei shuijin wo. <verse eid="REV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21"/>12 gie wijienshi 12 gie zhenzhughala giesan wo, nie wijienshi nie zhenzhu wo. Chenshini geidoushi gou antanghala giesan wo, gieghande boli niekielien wo.<verse eid="REV 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22"/>Bi chenshi sudoro dajien chanla dakushi Fugie Nenlitu Ezhan Hudaji ghoni ghughanshi chenshini dajien wo. <verse eid="REV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23"/>Chenshide naran, sarani gonni ulie kerekushi Hudai fama zhouizho, ghoni ghughanshi chenshini zhula wo. <verse eid="REV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24"/>Gojiala hhe gon dunda yone. Zemin jieredu honshanla famanine deilazhi hhe chenshide echine. <verse eid="REV 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25"/>Chenshini wijienyi izhi ulie khane, hhende xieni uwo. <verse eid="REV 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26"/>Kunla gojialani fama, zhiguini deilazhi hhende echine. <verse eid="REV 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27"/>Jien ganjin witu, pse hanzhan gieghachen, ghudan kieliechenlai hhende ulie oroghane. Zinie ghoni ghughanyi aminni jilasan benzi jiere nierei jilasanlai oroghane.<verse eid="REV 21:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1"/>Qienxien pse made nie amin winetu moronni uzheghazho, gieghande shuijinni xianli. Huda, ghoni ghughanyi baozose usuru khizhezhi <verse eid="REV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2"/>chenshini geidou dundase daozho. Moron lianmiende aminni mutun wine. 12 yan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">22:2</char> <char style="em">12 hui</char> </note> alima soune, nie sara 1 hui soune. Mutun lachen gojialai goudaghane. <verse eid="REV 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3"/>Kharasanla pse uwo. Chenshide Huda, ghoni ghughanyi baozo wine. Hhei hojila hhei beii <verse eid="REV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4"/>hhei ungiei chanlane. Hhei niere hhelai manlou jiere wine. <verse eid="REV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5"/>Pse xieni uwo, zhula, naranyi gonyi ulie kerene. Ezhan Hudai gon hhelai zhouizho. Hhela chanqi izhi honshan danlane.<verse eid="REV 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ersa Ireku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6"/>Qienxien pse made kieliewo, "Enezighan kielienshi kekao, zhenni wo. Ruhherghala xienzhilai zhughei gojiolughasan Ezhan Huda qienxienne peizhi deigo fashen giene giesan shiqinni hojiladene mejieghawo."<verse eid="REV 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7"/>"Uzhe, bi deigo irene. Jien ene shude melieshi kieliesei zunjisanlade fuqi wine!"<verse eid="REV 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8"/>Enezighan shiqinshi bi, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> sonosuzhi chanlasan wo. Bi sonosuzhi chanlase enezighanni made uzheghasan qienxienni kon konde papaladene hhei beiine giese <verse eid="REV 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9"/>hhe made kieliewo, "Ulie olune! Chi Hudai beii. Bishi chi, xienzhila, jiushi chii gaijiula, pse ene shude melieshi kieliesei zunjisanlare hhantu hoji danlasan wo." <verse eid="REV 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10"/>Hhe pse made kieliewo, "Ene shude melieshi kieliesei bu fenji. Shihou chadashiwo. <verse eid="REV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11"/>Gou witu kun gou wini giegha, zannantu kun zannanni giegha, gou kun gouni giegha, zhiguitu kun zhiguini giegha."<verse eid="REV 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12"/>
    <char style="pn">Ersa</char> kieliewo, "Uzhe, bi deigo irene! Jianli ogiku, faiku made wo, jien kun giesanzhe bi kharulune. <verse eid="REV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13"/>Bishi Alafa wo, Emeiga wo. Bishi zui melieshiku wo, zui kuinashiku wo, keitou wo, baraku wo."<verse eid="REV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14"/>Goya jienne waghazhi arughasanlade fuqi wine. Qienli bizhi aminni mutunyi hhende echine, wijiense chenshideye oro shidane. <verse eid="REV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15"/>Nogheila, fashu shuaichen, lon kijiechen, kun alachen, nigiedai beiichen, pse soyuji ghudan kieliekude xiqi bichen, jiani giechenla man chenshi ghadane wo.<verse eid="REV 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16"/>"Bi, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> jiohuilade oluzhi qienxienne peizhi enezighan shiqinyi tande ganzhen beighane. Bishi <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni houdei wo, eqiemaghaku gieghan hodun wo."<verse eid="REV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17"/>Shenlin shini biereighala, "Ire." giezhi kieliezho. Sonosusanlaye, "Ire." giezhi kielie. Undasusan kunla man ire. Duran bichen kunla man aminni usui belien jienlie.<verse eid="REV 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18"/>Bi ene shude melieshi kieliesei soyuji sonosusanlade jingao gieye. Kien ene melieshi kieliesande jiaise Huda ene shude huaisan zeinanni hhei jiere ireghane. <verse eid="REV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19"/>Ene shude melieshi kieliesei kien widaghase Huda ene shude huaisan aminni mutun, pse zhiguitu chenshide hhei bisan guzini widaghane.<verse eid="REV 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20"/>Ene shiqinlade ganzhen beisan kieliezho, "Enbene, bi deigo irene." Amine! Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ya, ire!<verse eid="REV 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21"/>Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni nenjien shentulare man hhantu bi gie. Amine!<verse eid="REV 22:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22"/>
</usx>
